{"schema":1,"revision":90100925,"page":{"pageid":8159769,"title":"夏末节","displayTitle":"夏末節","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>夏末節</b><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ohogain&#95;402&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ohogain_402-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>（<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%84%9B%E7%88%BE%E8%98%AD%E8%AA%9E\" title=\"愛爾蘭語\">愛爾蘭語</a>：<span lang=\"ga\">Samhain</span>，<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r88674605\">.mw-parser-output .IPA-label-small{font-size:85%}.mw-parser-output .references .IPA-label-small,.mw-parser-output .infobox .IPA-label-small,.mw-parser-output .navbox .IPA-label-small{font-size:100%}</style><span class=\"IPA-label IPA-label-small\">發音：</span><span class=\"IPA nowrap\" lang=\"ga-Latn-fonipa\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help:%E7%88%B1%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B0%E8%AF%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E9%9F%B3%E6%A0%87\" title=\"Help:愛爾蘭語國際音標\">&#91;ˈsˠəunʲ&#93;</a></span>、<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r88674605\" /><span class=\"IPA-label IPA-label-small\">蘇格蘭蓋爾語：</span><span class=\"IPA nowrap\" lang=\"gd-Latn-fonipa\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help:%E8%8B%8F%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%B0%E7%9B%96%E5%B0%94%E8%AF%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E9%9F%B3%E6%A0%87\" title=\"Help:蘇格蘭蓋爾語國際音標\">&#91;ˈs̪ãũ.ɪɲ&#93;</a></span>、<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r88674605\" /><span class=\"IPA-label IPA-label-small\">英語：</span><span class=\"IPA nowrap\" lang=\"en-Latn-fonipa\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help:%E8%8B%B1%E8%AA%9E%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E9%9F%B3%E6%A8%99\" title=\"Help:英語國際音標\">/ˈsɑːwɪn,<span class=\"wrap\"> </span>ˈsaʊɪn/</a></span>）是<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%93%8B%E7%88%BE%E4%BA%BA\" title=\"蓋爾人\">蓋爾人</a>的節日，每年的11月1日是夏末節，不過慶祝活動從每年的10月31日晚上就會開始。夏末節意味著豐收季的結束和冬季的開始。<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%88%B1%E5%B0%94%E5%85%B0\" title=\"愛爾蘭\">愛爾蘭</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%98%87%E6%A0%BC%E8%98%AD\" title=\"蘇格蘭\">蘇格蘭</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9B%BC%E5%B3%B6\" title=\"曼島\">曼島</a>曾普遍慶祝夏末節。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"参考文献\"><span id=\".E5.8F.82.E8.80.83.E6.96.87.E7.8C.AE\"></span>參考文獻</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%8F%E6%9C%AB%E8%8A%82&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：參考文獻\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-ohogain&#95;402-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-ohogain_402_1-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=D%C3%A1ith%C3%AD_%C3%93_h%C3%93g%C3%A1in&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Dáithí Ó hÓgáin（頁面不存在）\">Ó hÓgáin, Dáithí</a>. <i>Myth Legend and Romance: An Encyclopaedia of the Irish Folk Tradition</i>. Prentice Hall Press, 1991. p. 402. Quote: \"The basic Irish division of the year was into two parts, the summer half beginning at Bealtaine (May 1st) and the winter half at Samhain (November 1st) ... The festivals properly began at sunset on the day bef